Amiga: no lock-free pointer atomic assert, 8-byte NonInterferingBase (hunk
alignment limit); fix generic-port button margin typo; no frame icon for the
log window (Intuition windows have none).

diff -ruN a/libraries/lib-shuttlegui/ShuttleGui.cpp b/libraries/lib-shuttlegui/ShuttleGui.cpp
